  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF Strengthening Education and Child Protection Systems for Improved Learning and Child Wellbeing in Lebanon 2024-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF is aiming to strengthen the quality of learning as to be more child-centred and gender sensitive, along with improving the learning outcomes for children through the adaptation of play-based approaches that promotes children wellbeing and overall protection from violence and abuse. There is a focus on ensuring that the education in inclusive and ensuring that person with diabilities are included in the education system.
This is in partnership with the Lego Foundation that will have their own agreement with UNICEF Lebanon.</narrative>
  </description>
